WEBVTT

00:09.140 --> 00:11.440
As I thought, this is the new Tama picture!

00:12.070 --> 00:14.200
What a nice one! It's better than I expected.

00:14.200 --> 00:15.770
Hey, download it! Download it!

00:15.770 --> 00:18.210
We've been on the net for ten days now...

00:18.210 --> 00:19.570
...what should we do about school?

00:19.570 --> 00:22.360
We have no choice but to copy someone's notes on the way.

00:22.360 --> 00:24.000
Make it bigger, make it bigger!

00:24.000 --> 00:26.000
We can't return to society.

00:26.000 --> 00:27.380
Misuse is strictly prohibited!

00:27.380 --> 00:28.810
Hey, what is this?!

00:28.810 --> 00:29.590
What's wrong?

00:29.590 --> 00:30.960
Hey, look at this.

00:30.960 --> 00:32.310
Huh? Which one?

00:32.310 --> 00:34.220
Huh? Maybe this...

00:34.220 --> 00:35.990
Ooooh! I want to go!

00:35.990 --> 00:37.030
Could it be that you're jealous?

00:37.030 --> 00:39.120
W-Without a doubt!

00:39.120 --> 00:39.670
Hey...

00:39.670 --> 00:42.020
It's true! It's true!

00:45.260 --> 00:47.870
I shall tell you things unknown to you, so listen well.

00:47.870 --> 00:50.070
In this world, there is a strange melody.

00:50.070 --> 00:52.800
If you hear it, your heart will be poisoned. If you see it, your eyes will be ruined.

00:52.800 --> 00:55.170
An illustration of the momentary cry of pleasure.

00:52.800 --> 00:55.170
An illustration of the momentary cry of pleasure. {"ari kyoukan no goraku ezu" Literally as subbed, couldn't think of a better wording. - Ero_Yatsu}

00:55.170 --> 00:57.960
Coming is easy, but you cannot return.

00:57.960 --> 01:04.000
Nagasumi, a middle schooler of 15 years old,
is on the path to manhood.

01:16.630 --> 01:19.720
1000% no tennen

01:16.630 --> 01:19.720
1000% Natural

01:19.720 --> 01:22.640
adokenai pyua wa ikaga desu ka

01:19.720 --> 01:22.640
How about some pure innocence?

01:22.640 --> 01:25.640
hatenkou Smile Baby

01:22.640 --> 01:25.640
An angelic smiling baby.

01:25.640 --> 01:28.650
itareri tsukuseri

01:25.640 --> 01:28.650
Absolutely perfect.

01:28.650 --> 01:31.650
kicchiri shikatte hoshii no?

01:28.650 --> 01:31.650
Do you feel like firmly scolding?

01:31.650 --> 01:34.650
junjou Boy he komanai de

01:31.650 --> 01:34.650
Naive Boy, don't yield.

01:34.650 --> 01:37.700
ai de sekai o sukuou yo

01:34.650 --> 01:37.700
You're saving the world with love,

01:37.700 --> 01:40.620
awatezu sawagazu

01:37.700 --> 01:40.620
cool and without shouting.

01:40.620 --> 01:46.380
minna onaji yume o miteru

01:40.620 --> 01:46.380
Everyone has the same dream.

01:46.380 --> 01:52.340
hora koko he kureba yoku naru kara

01:46.380 --> 01:52.340
See, if you come here, things will get better.

01:52.340 --> 01:58.260
mada kimi no ondo piiku ga aru

01:52.340 --> 01:58.260
There is still a peak to be reached in your temperature.

01:58.260 --> 02:03.350
hohoemi nara ikura demo onedari

01:58.260 --> 02:03.350
Begging me for a smile as much as you can.

02:04.680 --> 02:07.480
tenshi ranman Love Power

02:04.680 --> 02:07.480
Glorious Angelic Love Power!

02:07.730 --> 02:10.550
genki hassan Love Hour

02:07.730 --> 02:10.550
Show your vitality! Love Hour!

02:10.550 --> 02:15.950
sutekina mono wa ima koko ni arimasu

02:10.550 --> 02:15.950
Fantastic things are right here now.

02:16.650 --> 02:22.410
romantikku shimashou happinesu shitai deshou

02:16.650 --> 02:22.410
Let's get romantic, you want to be happy, don't you?

02:22.610 --> 02:25.500
ureshii koto wa ima sugu ni

02:22.610 --> 02:25.500
Joyful things, right now!

02:25.760 --> 02:34.000
agemasu agemasu agemasu agemasu koko ni oide

02:25.760 --> 02:34.000
I'll give them, I'll give them, I'll give them, I'll give them,  come over here!

02:40.980 --> 02:43.600
U-Um... Well...

02:44.920 --> 02:47.190
Welcome,

02:47.190 --> 02:48.520
M-Master.

02:48.520 --> 02:49.980
S-She's a maid!

02:49.980 --> 02:50.610
She's a maid.

02:50.610 --> 02:53.030
Shiranui-san really did become a maid!

02:53.030 --> 02:54.620
Aah!! Y-You guys!

02:54.620 --> 02:56.080
Akeno-chi, that dress-

02:56.080 --> 02:57.280
I'm jealous!

02:58.200 --> 02:59.490
Why are you here?

02:59.490 --> 03:01.640
Buryo-san and the others informed us about it.

03:01.640 --> 03:03.000
Well, not really informed...

03:03.000 --> 03:04.180
They broadcasted it!

03:04.180 --> 03:05.450
It was them, eh?!

03:05.450 --> 03:07.030
Shiranui-san!

03:07.030 --> 03:08.790
As a member of the discipline committee,

03:08.790 --> 03:11.260
I can't ignore you working part-time without permission from the school.

03:11.260 --> 03:15.340
Ah! What you're saying is correct, but...

03:15.700 --> 03:18.920
I-I have a reason for this...

03:21.270 --> 03:23.510
Finally, you've returned from maintenance.

03:24.610 --> 03:26.890
The sword that was bestowed upon me by Master...

03:26.890 --> 03:29.560
Ak-Ak-Akeno-

03:33.380 --> 03:36.190
Therefore, I have to pay for the damage I've caused.

03:36.190 --> 03:39.100
How did you break the wall?

03:39.100 --> 03:42.030
Hehe, walls are very fragile things, aren't they?

03:42.030 --> 03:47.080
For that reason, committee member, I didn't want to make this public.

03:47.890 --> 03:50.200
I know it's a selfish request, but...

03:50.200 --> 03:53.830
Anyway, I'm responsible for this incident.

03:53.830 --> 03:56.580
Sorry, but could you do this for me?

03:57.610 --> 03:59.210
Sure, I won't report it.

04:00.510 --> 04:04.140
I just can't report people with debt!

04:04.140 --> 04:05.100
People with debts...

04:05.100 --> 04:09.520
The more you say, "debt, debt", the more miserable it makes me look...

04:09.820 --> 04:12.690
Okay, today is about friendship between girls!

04:12.690 --> 04:13.370
San-chan!

04:13.370 --> 04:14.080
Yes.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.710
We'll help out too!

04:15.710 --> 04:16.610
Huh?

04:18.670 --> 04:21.440
Welcome, Master.

04:22.000 --> 04:24.980
San-chan, didn't you say stuff like this is embarrassing?

04:29.790 --> 04:30.870
I-It suits you.

04:31.740 --> 04:33.790
T-Thank you.

04:34.330 --> 04:38.280
End of scene! End of scene! Good work, Master!

04:38.280 --> 04:40.860
Mawari, aren't you saying it a bit wrong?

04:40.860 --> 04:43.800
The manager said it was fine for me to take orders.

04:44.180 --> 04:46.930
That manager sure knows what he's doing.

04:46.930 --> 04:48.260
He gets it, huh?

04:48.260 --> 04:50.640
If you need proof, just look around!

04:50.960 --> 04:53.030
It's full of customers who heard the rumours!

04:53.030 --> 04:53.720
That rumour spread fast!

04:53.720 --> 04:55.220
There really are maids in here!

04:55.220 --> 04:56.660
Oh! So many to look at!

04:56.660 --> 04:59.900
San! I hear you're working part-time!

04:59.900 --> 05:01.500
I won't agree with this!

05:01.500 --> 05:02.940
Great success.

05:02.940 --> 05:05.590
Welcome, Master.

05:05.590 --> 05:07.570
My daughter is very cute, so I'll forgive her!

05:07.570 --> 05:10.920
Well then, sorry, but could you go and take orders now?

05:10.920 --> 05:12.040
Yes, Chief!

05:12.040 --> 05:13.860
I'll try my best!

05:15.000 --> 05:16.960
Welcome, Master.

05:18.230 --> 05:20.950
This is my first part-time job, but it's kind of fun.

05:20.950 --> 05:22.460
Maid-san!

05:22.460 --> 05:25.970
About the customer service... how much is OK?

05:25.970 --> 05:27.550
I'm gonna kill him!

05:27.550 --> 05:29.600
A job! This is a job!

05:29.600 --> 05:31.900
Masa-san, stop him!

05:31.900 --> 05:36.290
Boss, if you cause a commotion, you will hurt the lady's feelings.

05:36.290 --> 05:38.230
Welcome, Master.

05:38.550 --> 05:39.720
I'm home.

05:39.720 --> 05:41.310
Do you do takeouts?

05:41.310 --> 05:42.900
Alone we- Ah!

05:43.390 --> 05:45.870
Drinking alcohol, even in the afternoon...

05:45.870 --> 05:47.780
What a pathetic sea-monk.

05:47.780 --> 05:49.530
This is bad. Masa-san's at it as well!

05:49.930 --> 05:53.200
Hey, what's this, "Maid-san's Fufu Curry"?

05:53.200 --> 05:58.210
That's where we "fufu" the curry on your spoon, and feed it to you, Master-

05:58.210 --> 05:59.710
What?! What's with this menu?!

06:00.660 --> 06:01.880
All right, I want that with Seto-chan!

06:01.880 --> 06:04.350
I'm Seto Gouzaburou.

06:04.350 --> 06:05.510
Seto-chan!

06:11.510 --> 06:12.580
I can't take this any more!

06:12.580 --> 06:14.750
It's 1,300 yen, Master.

06:14.750 --> 06:17.690
Stop it! Let me go! You bastard!

06:17.690 --> 06:19.870
Bastards! Watch what you're doing!

06:19.870 --> 06:22.760
Father, you shouldn't frighten the customers!

06:24.140 --> 06:25.940
Here you go, and sorry for the trouble.

06:25.940 --> 06:29.390
I mean, welcome home, Master.

06:29.390 --> 06:31.310
I... I...

06:31.310 --> 06:33.250
I'll live seriously!

06:33.250 --> 06:35.510
It's okay. Take your time eating.

06:36.910 --> 06:39.710
Omawari-san!

06:41.180 --> 06:44.210
Hey, hey! There's an extra charge for being comforted!

06:44.210 --> 06:46.610
It's going well over there... I guess.

06:46.610 --> 06:48.490
That's some frightening skill she has!

06:48.490 --> 06:49.040
Yaaa!

06:49.040 --> 06:50.390
T-This voice...!

06:50.390 --> 06:51.900
Luna-chan!

06:53.080 --> 06:54.390
I heard about it, San!

06:54.390 --> 06:57.480
It seems like you have started a part-time job without telling me.

06:57.480 --> 06:59.120
Luna-chan, when did you-

06:59.120 --> 07:04.920
More importantly, San, how can a sheltered girl like you do such a tough service job?

07:04.920 --> 07:08.360
I'll prove to you that I'm better in a maid café!

07:10.240 --> 07:13.550
Luna-chan, are you going to work without pay for Akeno-chi, too?

07:14.230 --> 07:16.540
Hmph, everything I do is for my own benefit.

07:16.540 --> 07:19.970
And I don't need some paltry sum of money.

07:19.970 --> 07:21.260
Edomae Luna.

07:21.260 --> 07:24.960
Everyone's worried about you in their own way, Shiranui-san.

07:24.960 --> 07:27.730
But, I can't make you do this much-

07:27.730 --> 07:29.510
What are you saying? We're friends, right?

07:32.970 --> 07:38.770
I don't... have friends...

07:38.770 --> 07:41.940
Hey, hey! Why don't you have more self-confidence? Look!

07:41.940 --> 07:43.850
A group just arrived!

07:43.850 --> 07:45.760
Luna-sama's bodyguards, ready!

07:45.760 --> 07:47.530
For now, we'll take 30 seats!

07:47.530 --> 07:50.900
They're here! Welcome, Master!

07:50.900 --> 07:51.950
Aren't they working for you?!

07:52.240 --> 07:55.070
What are you saying? I want compliments!

07:56.440 --> 07:58.880
If you help to increase sales, then...

07:58.880 --> 07:59.950
You don't care.

07:59.950 --> 08:04.120
All right, all of you, order the most expensive item on the menu!

08:04.120 --> 08:06.900
And if you do, I'll serve you!

08:06.900 --> 08:08.120
Please allow me to!

08:08.120 --> 08:09.680
That smile!

08:09.680 --> 08:11.350
I'll be the first to-

08:11.350 --> 08:14.340
What? A smile for 10,000,000 yen?!

08:14.690 --> 08:15.680
Eh?

08:16.170 --> 08:17.640
Go ahead. Go ahead.

08:17.960 --> 08:20.520
What do you want, Master?

08:21.420 --> 08:26.310
As captain of Luna's bodyguards, as captain, as captain...

08:26.310 --> 08:28.120
Captain!

08:28.120 --> 08:29.190
Who in the world would order that?!

08:29.190 --> 08:30.990
I want one "smile," please.

08:32.230 --> 08:32.650
Papa!

08:32.650 --> 08:33.740
Luna's Papa!

08:34.250 --> 08:35.740
I've prepared the cash.

08:36.580 --> 08:39.370
I want your best smile, Luna.

08:42.670 --> 08:45.920
I refuse! Don't follow me everywhere, Papa!

08:45.920 --> 08:49.650
A daughter's smile cannot be obtained with money after all.

08:49.650 --> 08:52.010
You can get it for free... Keep trying.

08:52.990 --> 08:55.640
Oh, welcome, Master!

08:55.640 --> 08:58.010
Hey, there she is! Chivalrous onee-chan!

08:58.010 --> 08:59.410
Satori-chan!

08:59.410 --> 09:00.350
What, you know her?

09:00.350 --> 09:01.920
Idol, L-Luna!

09:01.920 --> 09:04.220
Thank you for your support!

09:04.220 --> 09:04.860
And who is she?

09:04.860 --> 09:05.930
An e-mail friend.

09:05.930 --> 09:07.800
What?! You send e-mails?

09:07.800 --> 09:10.060
Why haven't you told me your address?!

09:10.060 --> 09:12.230
Well... I see you all the time.

09:12.230 --> 09:13.530
Don't say that!

09:13.530 --> 09:16.030
See, see, I just got a picture-mail!

09:16.330 --> 09:19.430
Mawari forcefully took that and sent it...

09:19.430 --> 09:21.640
I wondered if I would make it in time.

09:21.640 --> 09:22.820
Thank you!

09:22.820 --> 09:25.670
Wow! Nagasumi Willis!

09:25.670 --> 09:28.430
Hey, don't call your elders by their first name, or without honorifics!

09:28.430 --> 09:30.790
What're you doing, maggot?

09:30.790 --> 09:33.800
Looks like you're quite popular among the elementary schoolers.

09:32.860 --> 09:33.800
Don't look!

09:37.500 --> 09:39.200
He's so cool!

09:39.200 --> 09:41.360
So stingy... I can feel that he's a really bad guy!

09:41.360 --> 09:43.140
Not really bad,

09:43.140 --> 09:44.750
Hard Bad?

09:46.180 --> 09:48.030
That person is my father.

09:48.030 --> 09:51.370
What? I'm jealous! He looks like he's from a chivalry movie. He's so cool!

09:51.370 --> 09:52.860
Nah, they're just really chivalrous people.

09:52.860 --> 09:56.140
What a good girl!

09:56.140 --> 09:59.110
Anyone want to give this girl a bottle?

09:59.110 --> 10:01.120
Please, go ahead.

10:01.120 --> 10:05.130
Hey, you shouldn't hang around Hard Bad people-

10:06.090 --> 10:08.000
My eardrums!!

10:08.890 --> 10:10.950
I just heard a familiar, shrill voice...

10:10.950 --> 10:12.050
Ah! Satori!

10:12.050 --> 10:13.170
Ah, Onii-chan!

10:13.170 --> 10:14.420
Eh? She's your little sister?

10:17.060 --> 10:18.280
Cute!

10:18.280 --> 10:19.920
Eh? Is it okay to wear this?

10:19.920 --> 10:22.090
Yes, since the manager said it was okay.

10:22.090 --> 10:25.020
Let's surprise your big brother and everyone else!

10:25.020 --> 10:26.600
They'll allow anything in this place...

10:26.880 --> 10:29.350
Hey, everyone... attention!

10:30.040 --> 10:32.630
This is our new maid, Satori-chan!

10:32.630 --> 10:35.820
Nice to meet you, Master.

10:37.070 --> 10:39.220
It's impressive being a maid at your age!

10:39.220 --> 10:41.190
There must be a reason for you to do this.

10:41.190 --> 10:43.030
Damn it, she's so moe!

10:43.650 --> 10:45.000
That girl isn't bad.

10:45.000 --> 10:47.690
But, she's merely an amateur when compared to the tremendousness of a professional.

10:47.690 --> 10:49.790
Watch this. This is professional acting!

10:52.380 --> 10:55.130
Actually, my mother...

10:55.720 --> 10:57.520
...when I was child...

10:58.170 --> 11:01.200
...she left me, and then died!

11:01.200 --> 11:02.450
Is that so?

11:02.450 --> 11:03.530
And your father?

11:03.530 --> 11:05.760
Dad died, too!

11:05.760 --> 11:08.440
If you were my dad...

11:10.170 --> 11:10.940
She's good.

11:10.940 --> 11:11.980
As expected from an active idol.

11:12.390 --> 11:15.650
I'm so happy now that I have so many big brothers!

11:15.970 --> 11:19.700
I don't have a brother, but I've always wanted one!

11:21.080 --> 11:22.180
Satori, was it?

11:22.180 --> 11:24.090
Oh! Chief!

11:24.090 --> 11:25.950
Older brothers are boring things.

11:26.200 --> 11:30.750
My brother abandoned all of his responsibilities and just disappeared.

11:30.750 --> 11:34.500
Expecting anything from an older brother, is a CERTAIN mistake!

11:38.130 --> 11:41.190
It looks like it's a nightmare, being part of a maid's family.

11:41.190 --> 11:43.010
Saru's wearing an expression I've never seen before!

11:43.010 --> 11:45.650
Mistress San, please.

11:45.650 --> 11:48.310
Please, cheer us up...

11:48.310 --> 11:51.810
Seto-chan's Original Menu: Fun Song (100 yen)

11:48.310 --> 11:51.810
Yes! My original menu item has finally been selected!

11:53.380 --> 11:56.230
Understood, Master!

11:56.230 --> 11:59.670
I'll sing with all I have, so please listen!

11:59.670 --> 12:03.740
Mermaid Ancient Lyric: Fun Song!

12:05.540 --> 12:08.870
Fufufu, what shall we do?

12:08.870 --> 12:11.870
This feeling!

12:12.150 --> 12:13.640
What a good song!

12:13.640 --> 12:15.250
Somehow, I'm having so much fun!

12:17.990 --> 12:20.470
San-chan's songs really are the best!

12:20.470 --> 12:21.980
As expected of San-chan!

12:21.980 --> 12:23.880
A fun song, eh.

12:23.880 --> 12:26.550
When it comes to songs, San-chan gives great service!

12:26.550 --> 12:28.890
Chivalry is the coolest!

12:30.380 --> 12:31.980
My song is better, San!

12:33.220 --> 12:38.450
Flap your wings, and overcome time.

12:38.450 --> 12:47.450
Then, everything within you will awaken!

12:49.370 --> 12:53.570
San! You ignore me, the idol Luna-sama, and sing a song as service?!

12:53.570 --> 12:54.580
I won't lose!

12:55.080 --> 12:58.680
We'll teach you a new lesson about fun with this song!

12:58.680 --> 13:02.470
Mermaid Ancient Lyric: Extreme Fun Song!

13:03.230 --> 13:05.390
This is an amazing song!

13:05.390 --> 13:09.560
It's so extreme, I can't stop head banging!

13:10.060 --> 13:10.720
Awesome!

13:10.720 --> 13:13.230
What is this?!

13:14.270 --> 13:15.520
Luna-chan, stop it!

13:15.520 --> 13:17.390
The manager is the best!

13:17.390 --> 13:21.780
Come on, you trash! Make some noise! Get ready!

13:24.730 --> 13:27.490
Luna-chan! Don't sing that song here!

13:27.490 --> 13:29.160
S-Stop it!

13:29.160 --> 13:30.660
You're going to...

13:30.660 --> 13:33.200
The store... the store will...

13:33.200 --> 13:35.210
Damn it... damn it!

13:35.210 --> 13:36.330
It's always like this!

13:36.880 --> 13:40.670
That, this, those, these... it's all my fault, isn't it?

13:40.670 --> 13:42.340
Am I broken goods?!

13:42.340 --> 13:43.550
Um, Shiranui-san?

13:43.550 --> 13:45.120
Geez, I can't take it any more!

13:45.120 --> 13:46.420
Everything!

13:46.420 --> 13:50.180
Disappear!

14:01.260 --> 14:05.450
Ah! The store... the store...

14:05.890 --> 14:07.460
I completely destroyed the store.

14:07.460 --> 14:10.410
W-What happened?

14:10.410 --> 14:12.140
Bus gas explosion?

14:12.140 --> 14:15.580
More importantly, look at all the glimmering stars in the sky!

14:15.910 --> 14:19.540
Our worries are tiny, aren't they?

14:19.820 --> 14:21.500
Indeed!

14:22.750 --> 14:25.340
I'll make you pay for today's destruction!

14:26.020 --> 14:27.830
In the end, this is what happens...

14:27.830 --> 14:31.100
Live a strong life, Akeno!

14:47.270 --> 14:49.070
Hey, Saturn!

14:49.070 --> 14:52.330
Let's be together, forever!

14:54.830 --> 14:56.370
It's a promise!

14:56.370 --> 14:58.210
Pinky swear!

15:01.140 --> 15:07.230
If I lie, I'll swallow a thousand needles...

15:13.170 --> 15:17.950
It was a hot, stormy night.

15:21.870 --> 15:25.270
When I think about it now... that rainy night...

15:26.800 --> 15:29.800
...it might have been the start of everything.

15:33.780 --> 15:35.660
What is this?

15:36.270 --> 15:38.750
This picture... is something...?

15:41.980 --> 15:43.420
N-No!

15:58.930 --> 16:00.680
Luna-chan, calm down.

16:00.680 --> 16:03.470
It's too scary for a ghost to come out of a picture!

16:03.470 --> 16:05.370
It's just a movie, right?

16:05.370 --> 16:07.190
What are you talking about? This! This!

16:07.190 --> 16:09.990
Look at this! I have one, too!

16:10.270 --> 16:11.420
What? A picture?

16:11.420 --> 16:12.930
A picture of a ghost!

16:12.930 --> 16:15.030
It's a picture that I took with San when we were kids!

16:15.410 --> 16:16.950
Look at this, here!

16:17.800 --> 16:18.790
What? What is this?

16:18.790 --> 16:22.620
It's from when I was a kid. I was too scared to throw it away!

16:23.020 --> 16:26.130
This is kinda creepy.

16:26.600 --> 16:27.130
Huh?

16:28.130 --> 16:29.670
What's wrong, Luna-chan?

16:29.670 --> 16:33.680
Hey... did we leave this door open?

16:33.680 --> 16:35.940
Huh? I don't know...

16:35.940 --> 16:38.650
Just now... I felt something behind me.

16:38.650 --> 16:42.950
What? Really... We're the only ones in the house right now.

16:42.950 --> 16:44.850
Luna-chan, you're letting that movie get to you.

16:46.150 --> 16:46.990
Hm?

16:53.230 --> 16:56.330
Why... did you open the window?

16:56.330 --> 16:58.370
Huh? What are you talking about...

16:58.370 --> 16:59.950
There's no way I opened it.

17:15.730 --> 17:17.450
H-Hello?

17:17.450 --> 17:18.960
Ah, Nagasumi-san?

17:18.960 --> 17:21.470
Oh, it's San-chan!

17:21.470 --> 17:24.440
I was planning to come home tonight, but...

17:24.440 --> 17:27.130
...Dad got drunk.

17:27.130 --> 17:28.090
Mum, I love you!

17:28.090 --> 17:30.280
Oh no, what a bother you are.

17:31.530 --> 17:34.250
Tomorrow is Monday... what's he going to do about work?

17:34.250 --> 17:37.540
I think I'll also be late for school, so go on ahead without me!

17:37.540 --> 17:39.280
Oh, San-chan, more importantly...

17:38.200 --> 17:39.280
Nagasumi?

17:39.280 --> 17:41.710
Make sure you close everything up, all right?

17:41.710 --> 17:42.830
More importantly, Mum!

17:42.830 --> 17:47.210
Human, you're the only one who I'll forgive for being in Luna's heart.

17:47.210 --> 17:51.670
If you do something wrong, I'll terminate you. Good night.

17:54.970 --> 17:56.990
It's just the two of us tonight.

17:56.990 --> 17:59.430
No one else is coming home tonight?!

17:59.430 --> 18:02.170
It seems they're having a big party with the family.

18:02.170 --> 18:03.980
We should have gone as well.

18:03.980 --> 18:08.200
I guess I didn't have a choice, since I have make-up exams.

18:08.980 --> 18:11.960
Geez, how could they have a party at a time like this?!

18:11.960 --> 18:14.320
Hey, Luna-chan, let's do our best at studying.

18:14.320 --> 18:16.700
I don't want to! I don't want to! I can't!

18:16.700 --> 18:18.490
I shouldn't have watched that scary movie!

18:21.160 --> 18:22.370
Huh?

18:28.770 --> 18:30.760
Rest in peace! Rest in peace! Rest in peace!

18:30.760 --> 18:32.660
W-What were those strange feet?!

18:32.660 --> 18:35.170
It's the ghost that came out of the picture!

18:35.200 --> 18:37.050
That's impossible!

18:37.050 --> 18:40.010
That reminds me, when I showed that picture to San, she said...

18:40.390 --> 18:42.390
Hey, look at this, this!

18:42.770 --> 18:47.140
I see. She came to see me, right?

18:47.140 --> 18:51.690
"See me"? But we were the only ones there.

18:52.730 --> 18:55.500
San, who's usually so forthcoming...

18:56.210 --> 18:58.890
...laughed as if there was something she couldn't quite say.

18:59.530 --> 19:02.660
I couldn't ask her anything about it!

19:02.660 --> 19:03.880
C-Calm down, Luna-chan!

19:03.880 --> 19:07.790
Maybe San's friend became a ghost, and came to see her!

19:07.790 --> 19:09.540
Go take a look!

19:09.540 --> 19:11.250
OK!

19:11.250 --> 19:12.920
I'll go look!

19:11.960 --> 19:14.230
No! Don't leave me alone!

19:14.230 --> 19:15.380
Choose one!

19:15.380 --> 19:17.590
I want you to stay with me!

19:22.600 --> 19:25.100
Surely, it must be San-chan.

19:34.340 --> 19:36.650
Hello? San-chan?

19:39.990 --> 19:41.660
Eh? What? San-chan?

19:42.600 --> 19:46.110
Hey San, no matter what you're doing, come back here immediately!

19:49.920 --> 19:50.550
San?

19:50.550 --> 19:51.810
San-chan?

19:52.880 --> 19:55.620
Even though you said we would be together forever...

19:55.620 --> 19:59.380
No! No!

19:57.770 --> 19:59.380
Luna-chan!

19:59.940 --> 20:01.610
Ouch!

20:04.680 --> 20:06.930
It's your fault!

20:21.830 --> 20:23.780
That night, at that moment,

20:24.270 --> 20:27.930
if we had met that terror face-to-face,

20:27.930 --> 20:31.930
that might not have even happened.

20:42.460 --> 20:43.430
Huh?

20:45.350 --> 20:47.740
A different school's uniform...

20:51.020 --> 20:54.740
Um, is there anything you need in our school?

21:03.590 --> 21:08.210
I'm telling you! I saw something supernatural last night, Zenigata-san!

21:08.210 --> 21:09.200
What?

21:09.670 --> 21:11.900
A ghost really came out of the picture!

21:11.900 --> 21:14.790
Maybe the ghost is still watching me!

21:15.710 --> 21:16.590
How idiotic.

21:17.140 --> 21:19.680
What is all this junk about ghosts?

21:19.680 --> 21:20.780
What do you know?

21:20.780 --> 21:24.840
If you look closely enough at what seems to be a ghost, it turns out to be the most normal of things.

21:24.840 --> 21:27.850
As expected from Master, he's full of useless knowledge!

21:27.850 --> 21:29.880
Did you see it as well, Nagasumi-kun?

21:29.880 --> 21:32.370
What? I...

21:32.370 --> 21:33.700
I didn't see anything!

21:33.700 --> 21:35.600
I'm sure we were just tired from studying too much.

21:35.600 --> 21:37.150
Why did you say that?!

21:37.150 --> 21:40.280
Shiranui-san, look at this picture!

21:40.970 --> 21:44.150
Last night, this ghost came out of the picture, and wandered around the house-

21:44.150 --> 21:45.910
Stop it!

21:46.270 --> 21:50.040
Shiranui-san, could it be that you're afraid of ghosts?

21:50.040 --> 21:52.090
Huh! I don't know what you're talking about.

21:52.090 --> 21:52.880
She's afraid.

21:53.020 --> 21:54.370
She's afraid.

21:54.880 --> 21:57.770
Once I saw that picture, I couldn't stop thinking about it.

21:57.770 --> 21:58.490
She's depressed.

22:02.550 --> 22:03.830
Huh?

22:03.830 --> 22:04.720
A blackout?

22:04.720 --> 22:05.470
What?

22:13.560 --> 22:15.560
Oh, Luna-chan, what's wro-

22:15.560 --> 22:18.970
Just now, in the hallway... a ghost...

22:18.970 --> 22:21.060
I'm scared of ghosts!

22:21.060 --> 22:24.140
Stop it already. Even Shiranui-san is playing along with you.

22:24.140 --> 22:25.570
But it's true!

22:25.570 --> 22:29.150
Geez, there's no way a ghost would be in the hallway.

22:29.150 --> 22:31.010
Beside, monsters don't...

22:31.010 --> 22:34.050
Ah! A monster!

22:37.350 --> 22:39.140
M-Master?

22:43.380 --> 22:46.950
No! I need you to stay with me!

22:46.950 --> 22:50.160
I can't! That thing seems to have business with me!

22:50.160 --> 22:51.440
If I don't check it out...

22:51.440 --> 22:53.160
How could you know that?!

22:53.160 --> 22:55.890
Yesterday, the ghost told me.

22:56.240 --> 22:57.890
Everyone, calm down!

22:57.890 --> 23:00.860
It's all right. Nothing's happening, and we don't know anything.

23:00.860 --> 23:03.820
That's right, let's just say that Master was absent today.

23:03.820 --> 23:05.400
We can't do that!

23:05.400 --> 23:06.650
Wait, Nagasumi!

23:07.100 --> 23:08.300
I'm not going with you.

23:08.300 --> 23:11.070
If you're my friend, you should say, "I'm coming too" at least.

23:12.140 --> 23:13.110
Mikawa?

23:13.110 --> 23:14.500
Mikawa-kun?

23:15.190 --> 23:18.210
I told you, I need you to stay with me!

23:18.210 --> 23:18.570
Oh!

23:20.680 --> 23:21.500
That!

23:21.500 --> 23:22.210
M-Mawari!

23:22.680 --> 23:23.970
Wait a sec!

23:24.580 --> 23:27.010
Hey, isn't it kinda dark?

23:28.080 --> 23:30.800
This appears to be a case of the Mikawa Company's heir disappearing.

23:31.330 --> 23:34.260
I will teach you the rules of society.

23:34.260 --> 23:39.900
Zenigata-san, I don't think this has anything to do with the rules of society...

23:39.900 --> 23:41.320
Zenigata-san?

23:42.630 --> 23:43.270
Mawari?

23:46.150 --> 23:47.390
Manservant!

23:51.410 --> 23:53.080
No!

23:54.170 --> 23:55.080
Everyone!

24:18.880 --> 24:23.020
W-What are you?! What kind of grudge do you have with the idol, Luna-sama?!

24:23.020 --> 24:24.400
San-chan...

24:24.880 --> 24:27.520
Where's San-chan?

24:28.650 --> 24:32.690
San will be here soon! What do you want with her?!

24:32.690 --> 24:34.160
Really?

24:38.570 --> 24:40.150
I'm glad.

24:43.590 --> 24:46.710
And then, everybody was gone.

24:48.690 --> 24:51.760
Wow! I'm so late!

25:05.070 --> 25:07.470
There is no one in any of the classrooms.

25:12.670 --> 25:14.140
There's no one here.

25:14.140 --> 25:15.700
Don't come near me!

25:19.020 --> 25:20.200
Luna-chan?!

25:20.200 --> 25:23.880
Luna-chan, what happened?

25:21.500 --> 25:23.880
No! Don't come near me!

25:23.880 --> 25:26.080
Luna-chan, what happened?

25:32.110 --> 25:35.390
So it was you who did this to my friends?

25:36.110 --> 25:38.140
If you've done this to my friends...

25:38.830 --> 25:41.060
...I'll settle this once and for all!

25:41.060 --> 25:43.890
I'm always so thirsty... so thirsty.

25:43.890 --> 25:46.490
Seaweed makes me so thirsty!

25:48.030 --> 25:49.320
San-chan?

25:50.290 --> 25:52.570
Saturn! It's been a whi-

25:52.570 --> 25:56.060
You remember me, right?

25:56.060 --> 25:58.490
I'm glad that I was brave enough to come here!

25:58.490 --> 26:01.690
Saturn! Didn't you go to Seto Inland?

26:01.690 --> 26:04.750
I wrote many letters to you,

26:04.750 --> 26:06.500
but there was no reply.

26:06.500 --> 26:10.240
Really? I didn't know anything about that...

26:10.240 --> 26:15.240
No way! I sent letters to you on seaweed every week!

26:15.240 --> 26:17.550
I used that in my miso soup, but that's what it was?

26:17.550 --> 26:20.650
I don't have any friends other than San-chan.

26:20.650 --> 26:26.140
Everyone said I had really long nails and didn't want to be friends with me!

26:33.230 --> 26:36.650
No! Nagasumi-san!

26:36.650 --> 26:39.320
Oh, them? They were annoying me.

26:39.720 --> 26:42.080
In the history of Isono No. 8 Middle School,

26:42.080 --> 26:45.580
this incident was known as...

26:45.580 --> 26:53.160
"The School's Saturn." A ghost story, which remained in the minds of many people.

26:55.270 --> 26:56.880
Leaving already?

26:56.880 --> 27:01.000
Yes, as I expected, it's hard to live outside of the sea.

27:01.000 --> 27:03.280
But I'm glad I got to see San-chan!

27:03.280 --> 27:05.060
It was great seeing you again.

27:05.060 --> 27:06.230
Yeah, it was...

27:07.550 --> 27:09.530
She was a mermaid friend?

27:09.530 --> 27:13.910
But all she did was create a mess. Then she had to go back right away.

27:13.910 --> 27:15.790
That's such a sad story.

27:15.790 --> 27:21.120
What are you saying? If Seto Gouzaburou hadn't done something, it would've been far worse.

27:21.120 --> 27:23.410
San-chan's father...?

27:24.370 --> 27:26.410
Only because she is San's friend...

27:26.410 --> 27:28.160
Shiranui-san!

27:28.160 --> 27:31.740
You sure became brave once you knew your enemy's true identity.

27:31.740 --> 27:34.020
And you stopped running around like an idiot.

27:34.020 --> 27:34.920
What did you say?!

27:35.300 --> 27:36.430
Stop it, both of you!

27:36.430 --> 27:40.330
Hey, San-chan, are you sure you won't come back with me to Seto Inland?

27:40.330 --> 27:43.930
If it's that chicken of a maggot, I'll execute him secretly...

27:45.330 --> 27:48.690
Although he's like that, he's my dear husband.

27:51.000 --> 27:52.690
You're a wonderful person.

27:53.100 --> 27:56.440
I like that part of you.

27:56.820 --> 27:58.370
Come back and play again!

27:58.370 --> 27:59.740
Yes, it's a promise!

28:00.550 --> 28:03.350
Pinky swear! If I lie,

28:03.350 --> 28:06.770
I'll swallow 1,000 needles!

28:06.770 --> 28:08.570
I promise!

28:10.750 --> 28:13.500
San-chan, let's play together again.

28:13.910 --> 28:15.710
Yes! Of course!

28:19.290 --> 28:20.480
See you later.

28:28.050 --> 28:32.740
suiheisen no mukou

28:28.050 --> 28:32.740
On the other side of the horizon...

28:32.740 --> 28:37.020
yuuhi no orenji

28:32.740 --> 28:37.020
...is the orange colour of the setting sun.

28:38.640 --> 28:43.190
hashaida natsu no ashiato

28:38.640 --> 28:43.190
The footprints we left behind by frolicking in the summer...

28:43.190 --> 28:46.960
kokoro ni shimau mitai

28:43.190 --> 28:46.960
It seems like they are locked up in my heart.

28:47.430 --> 28:53.230
asu wa dare mo wakaranai

28:47.430 --> 28:53.230
Nobody knows about tomorrow,

28:53.560 --> 28:58.360
dakedo ima wa kowaku wa nai yo

28:53.560 --> 28:58.360
but I'm not scared right now.

28:59.430 --> 29:03.000
hitomi o sotto tojireba

28:59.430 --> 29:03.000
When I lightly close my eyes,

29:04.660 --> 29:10.780
nakama-tachi ga waratteru

29:04.660 --> 29:10.780
I can hear my friends laughing.

29:10.900 --> 29:17.030
aoi umi to aoi sora

29:10.900 --> 29:17.030
The blue ocean and the blue sky...

29:17.030 --> 29:21.580
yureru hikari ni tsutsumaretara

29:17.030 --> 29:21.580
When I become enveloped in the swaying light,

29:22.140 --> 29:27.460
omoide ga aa afuretekuyo

29:22.140 --> 29:27.460
my memories all come back to me.

29:27.460 --> 29:35.950
kagayaki wa bokura no kakehashi ni naru

29:27.460 --> 29:35.950
The brightness will bring it all back to us.
